                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Simple game with a creepy atmosphere that does just what it needs to and not much more.  A bit over two hours for my run and I did enjoy it!\r\n\r\nStory is shockingly dark in places, but this is mostly down to how the game looks more than anything else.  I think the art style did not quite prepare me for something with a touch more grim content than I was thinking it would have.\r\n\r\nRegardless, I enjoyed it.  Quick run through and that was that!  One part was a touch annoying towards the end, but it was a fleeting moment and easily bypassed when you know what is going on.\r\n\r\nWould recommend if you have a few hours to kill and want something with a decent story, good atmosphere, and just enough content so that it does not overstay its welcome.",
